<h1>updateMoMaMe_EYECAL
</h1>

<h2><a name="_name"></a>PURPOSE <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>updateMoMaMe_EYECAL(option)</strong></div>

<h2><a name="_synopsis"></a>SYNOPSIS <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>function updateMoMaMe_EYECAL(option) </strong></div>

<h2><a name="_description"></a>DESCRIPTION <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="fragment"><pre class="comment"> updateMoMaMe_EYECAL(option)

 creates a project specific and totally modifiable update area in the
 MOMaMe figure using uicontrols. 
 
 inputs: 'initialize' --&gt;creates the uicontrols
         'update' --&gt; updates the counters.
         'reset' --&gt; resets the counters

 rbm 07.09</pre></div>

<!-- crossreference -->
